database exports that

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.502
are imported into BigQuery.

00:10:07.502 --> 00:10:08.710
FILLIPO MADELLA: Thanks, Dan.

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:11.530
I love the way you're
