00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:15.970
DAN SCHLOSSER: Yeah, absolutely.

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:20.620
For us, Firebase Authentication
has been extremely powerful.

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:25.540
It uses JWTs that allow us
to authenticate requests

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:30.190
