and client-side navigation.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:32.750
It made it super easy to
set up Google, Facebook,

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:34.810
and password
authentication, as well

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:37.060
as anonymous authentication.

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:39.520
That anonymous auth has
been especially useful

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:40.940
for our free tools.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:46.840
Because when we start asking
people about their operation,

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:49.690
we don't want to say
